specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:388:- The server sends a WebSocket `ping` frame at the configured `heartbeatIntervalMs` interval (default 30 seconds)
specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:389:- If a client doesn't respond with `pong`, the connection is terminated
specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:390:- The client can also send application-level `ping` messages
